code who's calling today from 2 8 1.

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:06.470
Exodus.

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:08.069
Sam, can you hear me?

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:10.240
Yes, and what's going on?

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.980
Well, you see, I'm in a pickle.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:19.520
I got a call from my brother and he said that
it hits the fan that he's going to describe

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:24.470
over and then take me to our family bunker
square, they have apparently to three years

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:26.070
